      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abram said, Behold, to me thou hast given no seed: and lo, one born in my house is my heir.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And behold, the word of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "came",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to him, saying, This shall not be thy heir; but he that shall come forth out of thy own bowels shall be thy heir.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought him forth abroad, and said, Look now towards heaven, and tell the stars, if thou art able to number them: and he said to him, So shall thy seed be.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he believed in the LORD; and he counted it to him for righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to him, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD that brought thee out of Ur of the Chaldees, to give thee this land to inherit it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said, Lord God, by what shall I know that I shall inherit it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to him, Take me a heifer of three years old, and a she-goat of three years old, and a ram of three years old, and a turtle-dove, and a young pigeon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he took to him all these, and divided them in the midst, and laid each piece one against another: but the birds he did not divide.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when the fowls came down upon the carcases, Abram drove them away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when the sun was going down, a deep sleep fell upon Abram; and lo, a horror of great darkness fell upon him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said to Abram, Know certainly that thy seed shall be a stranger in a land ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not theirs, and shall serve them; and they shall afflict them four hundred years;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And also that nation which they shall serve, will I judge: and afterward shall they come out with great substance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt go to thy fathers in peace; thou shalt be buried in a good old age.",
