        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But in the fourth generation they shall come hither again: for the iniquity of the Amorites ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not yet full.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.15.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.15.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, that when the sun had gone down, and it was dark, behold a smoking furnace, and a burning lamp that passed between those pieces.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
